      <button class="sw-preset-btn" id="sw-bench-btn" title="Range Rover L460 competitive benchmark — vs BMW X7 / Audi Q8 / Mercedes GLS / Porsche Cayenne, real drivetrains only">L460 Competitive Benchmark</button>
